  "title": "Kourovka problem 5.5 (main)",
  "statement": {
    "representation": "pdf-text-entry",
    "text": "If G is a finitely generated abelian-by-polycyclic-by-finite group, does there exist\na finitely generated metabelian group M such that G is isomorphic to a subgroup\nof the automorphism group of M ? If so, many of the tricky properties of G like its\nresidual finiteness would become transparent.                          B. A. F. Wehrfritz",
